  "job_B20.12.2_20251003_114510": {
    "text": "Horalogium, Horarum breue inchoat en hic. On VIII kalend Ianuarii \u00fe\u00e6t by\u00f0 on cristes m\u00e6sse d\u00e6g by\u00f0\nOn VIII idus Ianuarii \u00fe\u00e6t ys on \u00feone twelftan d\u00e6g by\u00f0 seo sceadu to underne & to none XXV fota & to\nOn XII kalend Februarii bi\u00f0 seo sceadu to underne & to none an & twentig fota & to midd\u00e6ge ehtatyne\nOn II non Februarii by\u00f0 seo sceadu to underne & to none ehta teo\u00fean healfes fotes & to midd\u00e6ge fiftyne.\nOn XII kalend Martii bi\u00f0 seo sceadu to underne & to none fiftyne fota & to midd\u00e6ge twelfe.\nOn II non Martii bi\u00f0 seo sceadu to underne & to none \u00fereottyne fota & to midd\u00e6ge teo\u00fean hielfes.\nOn XII kalend Aprelis \u00fe\u00e6t is emnihte by\u00f0 seo sceadu to underne & to none endlufon fota & to midd\u00e6ge\nOn non Aprelis bi\u00f0 seo sceadu to underne & to none teo\u00f0an healfes fotes lang & to midd\u00e6ge forneah\nOn XII kalend Maii by\u00f0 seo sceadu to underne & to none ehta fota & lytel eaca & to midd\u00e6ge forneah\nOn II non Maii by\u00fe seo sceadu to underne & to none forneah ehta fota & to midd\u00e6ge fiftan healfes.\nOn XII kalend Iunii bi\u00f0 seo sceadu to underne & to none seofon fota & to midd\u00e6ge feower.\nOn kalend Iunii bi\u00f0 seo sceadu to underne & to none lytle lengre \u00feonne seofon fota & to midd\u00e6ge\nOn idus Iunii bi\u00f0 seo sceadu to underne & to none ehto\u00f0an healfes fotes lang & to midd\u00e6ge feower.\nOn VIII kalend IVLI \u00fe\u00e6t ys on Iohannes m\u00e6sse d\u00e6g bi\u00f0 seo sceadu to underne & to none wel neh ehta\nOn II non IVLI bi\u00f0 seo sceadu to underne & to none eahta fota & to midd\u00e6ge lytle mare \u00feonne feower.\nOn XII kalend Agvsti bi\u00f0 seo sceadu to underne & to none ehta fota & lytle mare & to midd\u00e6ge fiftan\nOn VIII ID Agvsti bi\u00f0 seo sceadu to underne & to none nigo\u00fean healfes fotes lang & to midd\u00e6ge lytle\nOn duodecima kalend Septembris bi